bindings: layout checks are x86_64 only

The pregenerated bindings assert x86_64 struct sizes, which fail on
32-bit targets; the definitions themselves are portable.

--- a/src/bindings/libevdev.rs
+++ b/src/bindings/libevdev.rs
@@ -56,6 +56,7 @@
